  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Capacity development Ministry of Education PF - Capacity development PF MEST</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Kapacitetsutvecklingsst&#xf6;d utbildningsministeriet</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till kapacitetsutveckling inom utbildningsministeriet. Kosovos   utbildningsstrategi tar upp att en f&#xf6;ruts&#xe4;ttning f&#xf6;r en effektiv      implementering av strategin &#xe4;r att kapaciteten st&#xe4;rks. Ett            kapacitetsutvecklingsprogram finns inkluderat i strategin och detta   &#xe4;r det som st&#xf6;d utg&#xe5;r till att implementera. Kommer finansieras genom en gemensam finansieringsmodell tillsammans med andra givare.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to capacity development at Ministry of Education,Science and  Technology. Kosovo&apos;s education strategic plan (KESP) states that for  an effective implementation of the educational reform, capacity       development is a prerequisite. A capacity develeopment program is     included in KESP as an annex. This programme is what is to be         supported, through a joint financing mechanism.</narrative>
  </description>
